{"resourceIdentifier":"3640","resourceName":"3A BES Akyurt Biogas Power Plant","description":"3A BES Akyurt Biogas Power Plant, built and operated in Ankara Province, Akyurt Distrcit, has an installed capacity of 4 MWe. The purpose of the project activity is to produce electricity from poultry and cattle manure with biomethanization process which will also result in fermented products that could be utilized as fertilizers by local farmers. 3A BES Akyurt Biogas PP has received its renewed generation license from EMRA on 26/12/2019. As per the generation license, the annual expected generation is 28,000 MWh/year.\r\nThe facility is planned to consist of 3 co-generation units. The first and second unit was commissioned on 28-10-2020, each with an installed capacity of 1.501 MWe. Accordingly, project activity start date is 28-10-2020. The remaining unit with an installed capacity of 0.998 MWe is planned to be commissioned in 2023.\r\nThe facility is expected to generate 28,000 MWh/year and 584,000 m3/year biogas when operational capacity is 4 MWe. It is estimated that the project help reduce the carbon emissions by 113,198 tCO2e annually. The total emission reduction for the whole crediting period is calculated as 792,388 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":40.122391,"longitude":33.254220},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-05","endExclusive":"2023-02-05","endInclusive":"2023-02-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3640"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Akyurt"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"113198"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"15/10/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 28/10/2020 - 27/10/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72283&IDKEY=u8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0f99678257","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-v4.1-Akyurt.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-10T14:38:58.687Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=76163&IDKEY=9iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf3105028777","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-v4.1-Akyurt (1).pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-13T11:41:12.353Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72284&IDKEY=0iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfm99679636","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"3a Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-08-10T14:39:58.393Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=120293&IDKEY=0903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfs165884047","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"3640_PD_V10_CL.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-10-15T08:27:09.38Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=90914&IDKEY=9iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfn125370406","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"3A Bes_ VCS-Registration-Representation-Multiple-Representors-v4.pdf